  "timing": "visual beat, then complete measured narration and reading floor; UI playback speed adjusts voice and timeline together",
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "c0-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c0-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 6.725,
      "text": "先看右上宫殿、下方辞行、左上城池：一幅画串起三个环节。",
      "bytes": 81837,
      "sha256": "ed9da7131b2a1e35fdb8cd17942cebb718909da2379ea1aa5e37b619139a0302"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c0-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "这是初唐画家讲述的汉使西行，已经距张骞的时代数百年。",
      "bytes": 78957,
      "sha256": "7270f834a0cf7c4e4dca9dfbce0141801ea1b949380775613062fcce3a0056a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c0-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 6.375,
      "text": "先跟着画面走，再用史书追问：他为何出发，又带回了什么？",
      "bytes": 77517,
      "sha256": "2ae9d738445f80329994bfc6d65b53142312a0d3e3f51736f17282c280416c43"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c1-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 7.075,
      "text": "右上宫殿里，帝王与群臣向两尊金人礼拜；画家把金人画成了佛像。",
      "bytes": 85869,
      "sha256": "4349c14dd9ab3fda4c14add158eeb72a02f3bc7390feb182e9c417614d237c8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c1-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "画旁题记说，皇帝不知金人名号，便派张骞到大夏询问。这是壁画给出的出发理由。",
      "bytes": 124461,
      "sha256": "d57749f76a521b7c45775d6f70c32175ca87b7beb2ac89cc6f8d25b369c7da89"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c1-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.435,
      "text": "《史记》记有匈奴祭天金人，却未说它是佛像；把两者相连，是后来的佛教讲述。",
      "bytes": 114381,
      "sha256": "7eee8878fb17e5c10a013209c0c18116122540d0e2ad8591f0d48a1060ad193b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c2-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "下方，张骞向骑马的帝王跪拜辞行。壁画把这次出发接在礼拜金人之后。",
      "bytes": 113805,
      "sha256": "335dd4d7958e1f9bbcfea2f6d706c8a7a492df99dbdcdc4869816e4b7bcf212e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c2-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "史书中的首次出使有另一个起点：汉武帝想联合西方的月氏，一同对抗匈奴。",
      "bytes": 111501,
      "sha256": "d41499837cc36c5b177412b98cce8fdc4b27cf4e9136c3153ce9e7f4ee89c458"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c2-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "月氏曾被匈奴击败、王被杀害。汉朝以为这份旧仇，能换来一个盟友。",
      "bytes": 87309,
      "sha256": "b8c81cb5cb6ed444709ded1d47e71554f918249692601342f30055bbc10a1e1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c3-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "目光转向左侧，汉使走进山间。画家用山路，把辞行与远方城池连接起来。",
      "bytes": 116397,
      "sha256": "ae2bce8bf4a61df81f2be87ff0aa4928d759343029fdc6a6fcf5f671b6b9bf65"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c3-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "首次出使必须经过匈奴控制的地带。张骞还没见到月氏，就被扣留十余年。",
      "bytes": 110925,
      "sha256": "b56e1ad3aedef32991b7c454dd9a93ef94b58ce47fb2768b8cbb44ad6f360812"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c3-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.535,
      "text": "逃出后，他继续向西，经大宛、康居到达大月氏。路走通了，联盟却仍没有着落。",
      "bytes": 115533,
      "sha256": "bc92163ec9077e5d69741ade63330a5b16f8f81f19c0949484eb81071011f1b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c4-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 7.125,
      "text": "再看左侧的长杆旌节：它提示观者，这是一支代表汉朝出行的使团。",
      "bytes": 86445,
      "sha256": "4c378837a986b12912de2174b6a13ce135ca3d562b13f59333c57ad385151284"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c4-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "《史记》说，张骞被扣多年仍未丢失汉节。他没有放下使者身份与出使任务。",
      "bytes": 114957,
      "sha256": "31a5590e44708b0ae04007acd194fc51806f0e1070fefab6523cfbd130438d80"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c4-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.635,
      "text": "但月氏已在西方安居，既少战乱，又离汉朝太远；他们不愿为旧仇再开战，联合没有达成。",
      "bytes": 128781,
      "sha256": "ed0a9fc237e4ea94e624daabb7899d612873ecfecd2983035219c7c3037c97a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c5-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "山道尽头是左上城池。使者朝城门走去，壁画把这里题作大夏。",
      "bytes": 84429,
      "sha256": "f2a483bcc3ae25af7caf26886d1fe013bbe5ef7c460fb91a8581b492090c4feb"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c5-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 7.075,
      "text": "张骞确曾到过大夏。《史记》写那里有城屋与市场，商人贩卖各方货物。",
      "bytes": 85869,
      "sha256": "92e56b853d42ff9e9b44bbc8845901ef01691215f55299fd92e79e1042132031"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c5-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "他看见蜀布和邛竹杖，得知商人从身毒买来：联盟未成，却带回了新的远方信息。",
      "bytes": 124749,
      "sha256": "c00564534f0d1baa82cf30f47ee5c510b2bb26d50c21203daa574668f400e3b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c6-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.085,
      "text": "城门边有两位僧人，城里有佛塔。它们回答了画家前面的问题：金人被解释为佛像。",
      "bytes": 122157,
      "sha256": "d9f3d74e0731c1c9ddf18a92086b7428445beaccbc3ef0088068ec79e9675e4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c6-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 6.825,
      "text": "《史记》写张骞见蜀物、听说身毒，却没有记他在大夏问佛像名号。",
      "bytes": 82989,
      "sha256": "eeaef7e0b797d07cdc7f190c398db12d0ebde59358d80e9d4869706d0492b900"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c6-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "后来佛教叙事把西行接到佛教传入的故事里；壁画画上僧人与塔，也给远行换了含义。",
      "bytes": 120429,
      "sha256": "bf129a2efee7605e3df826f010b07c06a4700cecebe45e263c0706502d658eee"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7-0",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c7-0.mp3",
      "seconds": 9.935,
      "text": "回看全画：宫殿礼拜、使者辞行、抵达城池，三个画面组成一次有起因、有终点的西行。",
      "bytes": 120141,
      "sha256": "63573b9aacfd6d3ae0a1e09a13bc8b39e3216fc13747966cd0de10fce7665d57"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7-1",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c7-1.mp3",
      "seconds": 11.135,
      "text": "史书的结局是未能联合月氏，却把西域见闻带回汉朝；往后的使者沿这些联系继续往来。",
      "bytes": 134541,
      "sha256": "75109eb585ee25a198955c64a00f7ca40bb448cec6063ee43c868f4ba86b4271"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7-2",
      "file": "/mural-assets/narration-v3/c7-2.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.785,
      "text": "唐代画家又用同一位使者讲佛教传播。我们读懂了画中故事，也认出了它与汉代史实的距离。",
      "bytes": 130509,
      "sha256": "22b44ac5473b2b584e77e4ff4088f9f9bcd6e7fcf68efa072d1bcae84bdf5885"
    }
  ],
